cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AIDAS: Argonne AI-Driven Adaptive Sampling System"
abbreviation: AIDAS
abstract: >-
  AIDAS is a Python package for AI-guided instrument tasking over the Argonne
  Testbed for Multiscale Observational Studies (ATMOS). It detects mesoscale
  boundaries, such as lake breeze fronts, in NEXRAD radar data using deep
  learning models, and uses those detections to cue the scan strategy of
  ground-based instruments including Halo Photonics Doppler lidars.
